  m_Name: Story_dad
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcStoryArc
  npcId: dad
  title: The First Dollar
  summary: 'Thirty years behind the till. Jae-hoon wants the store to outlive him, but the tower''s prices and a Sterling-owned wholesaler squeeze him. Fork: become the town''s local shop, stocked from your farm, or take Sterling''s franchise offer.'
  pathAName: The local supplier
  pathBName: The franchise
  parts:
  - title: The frame under the till
    number: 1
    heartsNeeded: 1
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - You see that little frame under the till? The first dollar this store ever took. Thirty years ago, from Rosa Delgado, for a loaf of bread she'd baked herself.
    - My wife says I should spend it. I say some things are worth more than a dollar.
    happy: 0
