      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: From the farm
    number: 3
    heartsNeeded: 3
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Let's try it. Bring me ten of something you grow, and I'll put it by the till with a sign. 'From the farm.' Hand-written, so people know it's real.
    - Turnips, maybe. Nia Abara says nobody likes turnips. I want to prove her wrong.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 918ea0bc1100ac64ab941ae10a07620e, type: 2}
      amount: 10
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: From the farm
      questText: Jae-hoon wants 10 Turnips to sell by the till under a hand-written 'From the farm' sign.
      reminder:
      - Still bringing me those turnips? Ten. I've already written the sign. It's very good. Soo-ah fixed the spelling.
      thanks:
      - Look at these! Dirt and all. Perfect.
      - Here, I'll pay you what the tower would, and a little more for the walk.
    choice:
      enabled: 0
      optionA: 
      replyA: []
      flagsA: []
      optionB: 
      replyB: []
      flagsB: []
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 220
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: The wholesaler
    number: 4
    heartsNeeded: 4
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Sunday I went to my wholesaler in the city, same as every Sunday for twenty years.
    - New sign over the door. 'A Sterling Company.' And new prices. Everything up by a third, but only for small shops. The tower pays the old price.
    - The man at the desk was very sorry. He said it three times. Sorry doesn't stock shelves.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
